			"id":"54af69f0cd6ae0a0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"get z-axis working\n\n#### okay\nz-axis needs to connect to hitbox and change its layer based on z-axis value\nz-axis must connect to ability manager\n- ability should have a field `affected by z-axis`\n- so that abilities that have hurtboxes can change hurtbox layer based on z-axis\nphysicscomponent needs to connect to z-axis; collisions should not happen between entities that are 5 z units apart (?)\n\nz-axis needs a reference to sprite `scale` to generate a shadow of a particular size\nshadow should decrease in size the higher up z value is\n\nshadows\njumping\n\nverify that the hitbox/hurtbox levels work by making a flying entity",
